# Lowercase `select`: DS0104 pointing at `project`, with a fix.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | select customerId, amount
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..41
  PIPELINE@0..40
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    PROJECT_OP@15..40
      IDENT@15..21 "select"
      WHITESPACE@21..22 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@22..32
        NAME_REF@22..32
          IDENT@22..32 "customerId"
      COMMA@32..33 ","
      WHITESPACE@33..34 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@34..40
        NAME_REF@34..40
          IDENT@34..40 "amount"
  WHITESPACE@40..41 "\n"

error[DS0104]: unknown operator `select`
  --> query:1:16
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | select customerId, amount
  |                ^^^^^^ not a DataScript operator
  |
  = help: to choose or compute columns, use `project`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    'orders.csv' | project customerId, amount
which parses without errors
